# HuggingFace token for downloading the Turing Synthetic Radar Dataset (TSRD)
# Required ONLY if you want to download real radar data.
# The project runs fully without this token using synthetic data.
#
# To get a token:
#   1. Create account at https://huggingface.co
#   2. Go to https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens → New token (read access)
#   3. Accept the dataset agreement at:
#      https://huggingface.co/datasets/alan-turing-institute/turing-synthetic-radar-dataset
#   4. Copy the token below (format: hf_xxxxxxxxxxxx)
#
# To use: copy this file to data/.env and fill in your token.

HF_TOKEN=your_huggingface_read_token_here
